      "trackName": "Word Search Watch Game",
      "description": "A complete word-search adventure made for your wrist.\n\nEnjoy quick, satisfying word puzzles against a colorful tropical backdrop. Swipe across the letter grid, find every hidden word, and move through 300 increasingly challenging levels.\n\n• 300 handcrafted word-search levels\n• Smooth horizontal, vertical, and diagonal selection\n• Find words forward or backward\n• Helpful hints when you get stuck\n• Colorful completion effects and original game sounds\n• Music and sound controls\n• Progress saved automatically\n• Designed for quick offline play\n\nWhether you have a spare minute or want a longer puzzle session, Word Search Watch Game makes every glance at your wrist more playful.\n\nFind the words, complete the board, and continue your tropical journey.",
